          "settings": {
            "html": "<section class=\"dq-promise\">\n  <div class=\"dq-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"dq-eyebrow-dark\">What you walk away with</span>\n    <h2 class=\"dq-h2\">Not a score. A <em>starting point.</em></h2>\n\n    <div class=\"dq-grid\">\n      <article class=\"dq-card\">\n        <span class=\"dq-num\">01</span>\n        <h3>Your regulation type</h3>\n        <p>One of four patterns describing how your body responds to stress. Named, so you can recognise it in yourself.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"dq-card\">\n        <span class=\"dq-num\">02</span>\n        <h3>A practice sequence</h3>\n        <p>Three starting practices, in order, matched to your pattern. Breathwork, somatic work and a daily ritual.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"dq-card\">\n        <span class=\"dq-num\">03</span>\n        <h3>The full prescription</h3>\n        <p>Audio sessions, a workbook and reference material. Yours to keep and return to.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n.dq-promise {\n  background: #F7F0EC !important;\n  padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem) 1.5rem !important;\n}\n\n.dq-wrap { max-width: 1080px !important; margin: 0 auto !important; }\n\n.dq-eyebrow-dark {\n  font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif !important;\n  font-size: 0.62rem !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0.34em !important;\n  text-transform: uppercase !important;\n  color: #688F9D !important;\n  display: block !important;\n  margin-bottom: 1.75rem !important;\n  text-align: center !important;\n}\n\n.dq-h2 {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem) !important;\n  font-weight: 300 !important;\n  line-height: 1.12 !important;\n  color: #0E1B30 !important;\n  text-align: center !important;\n  margin: 0 0 4.5rem !important;\n}\n\n.dq-h2 em { font-style: italic !important; color: #688F9D !important; }\n\n.dq-grid {\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important;\n  gap